{"metadata":{"description":"Evidence-grounded bilingual academic research plugin for DeepSeek Harness and OnPeople","id":"gh:1333685905","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-academic-research","slug":"userInner/dsh-academic-research","topics":["academic-research","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","literature-review"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Evidence-grounded bilingual academic research plugin for DeepSeek Harness and OnPeople"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# `@onpeople/dsh-academic-research`"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An independent `dsh-plugin` for DeepSeek Harness and OnPeople. It adds a bilingual, evidence-grounde"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"d academic research collaborator without requiring an account or a licensed database connection."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The plugin provides:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- literature discovery through public Crossref and OpenAlex APIs;
- retrieval of a specific public H"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"TTPS research record or paper page;
- source status and coverage information;
- evidence-aware bilin"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"gual literature review, academic writing, citation checking, and reviewer-response guidance;
- resea"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"rch-integrity rules that prohibit fabricated sources, data, quotations, experiments, and peer-review"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"grity rules that prohibit fabricated sources, data, quotations, experiments, and peer-review claims."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The package contains both the standard `.codex-plugin/plugin.json` metadata and a native DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rness Cordis plugin. The `.onpeople/industry.json` companion lets OnPeople expose the same package a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s a selectable industry plugin; the DSH runtime uses `src/index.ts` and `cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install in DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The package is designed for profile-scoped installation. From a DSH checkout or an installed `dsh` c"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"kage is designed for profile-scoped installation. From a DSH checkout or an installed `dsh` command:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Until the package is published, install a local checkout instead:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"For a GitHub release, publish this directory as its own repository and add the
`dsh-plugin` topic so"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" it can be discovered with the rest of the ecosystem."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"After installation, restart the profile. The package declares a `dsh.bundle` patch, so the profile a"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"utomatically mounts the plugin row. It is not enabled in unrelated profiles."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Use it"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Ask the agent directly, for example:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Search 2020–2024 English papers on graph neural networks for recommender systems. Build an evidenc"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e matrix with title, authors, year, DOI, source URL, and evidence limits."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The plugin's tools are:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `research_search` | Search Crossref and OpenAlex public metadata. |
