| `research_source_status` | Describe the public source c"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"overage and limitations. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The search tools are read-only and do not accept credentials. Public metadata, abstracts, and full-t"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ext links are reported as different evidence levels; a link is never treated as proof that the full "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"eported as different evidence levels; a link is never treated as proof that the full paper was read."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The package intentionally keeps provider calls in the plugin and uses only standard `fetch`; no cust"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"om UI is required. A host can compose it with its existing tool presentation, Skills, permissions, a"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"pprovals, and model settings."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview and its plugin APIs may change. This package targets the pr"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ofile-bundle contract available in the current `master` line and keeps the host-specific metadata de"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"clarative so a future manifest change can be handled without changing the research workflow content."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT. See LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}
